<title>UK: WestLB sets warrants on Deutsche Telekom.</title>
<headline>WestLB sets warrants on Deutsche Telekom.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westdeutsche Landesbank Girozentrale says it has issued 10 million American-style call and put warrants, in five equal tranches, on Deutsche Telekom.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one shares.</p>
<p> WARRANTS	    STRIKE	    ISS PRICE</p>
<p> CALL A		33.00 DEM	 2.91 DEM</p>
<p> CALL B		36.00 DEM	 1.70 DEM</p>
<p> CALL C		39.00 DEM	 0.92 DEM</p>
<p> PUT D		 33.00 DEM	 2.86 DEM</p>
<p> PUT E		 29.00 DEM	 1.42 DEM</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 27.NOV.96-19.DEC.97   PAYDATE	27.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   DDF FFT		   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  33.00 DEM</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
